SpiderHost (feasibility spike)

Parts of this project are adapted from Kototoro
(https://github.com/kototoro-app/Kototoro), licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

- app/src/main/kotlin/com/oksen/spiderhost/DexInspector.kt
  (protected-Init detection, from TVBoxProtectedInitDetector.kt; restructured)
- app/src/main/kotlin/com/oksen/spiderhost/SpiderRunner.kt
  (protected/standard Init strategy and Context seeding, from TVBoxJarSpiderRuntime.kt
   and TVBoxProtectedInitCompat.kt; rewritten)
- app/src/main/kotlin/com/oksen/spiderhost/TvboxConfig.kt (jar spec parsing)
- app/src/main/kotlin/com/oksen/spiderhost/LocalServer.kt (/proxy routing)
- app/src/main/java/com/github/catvod/** and app/src/main/java/com/whl/quickjs/**
  (host-side class shapes and obfuscated stub method names the jars link against)

Each adapted file carries a header noting its origin and changes.
A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
